-- a code with every definition it names that is not kept (hs) replaced by its code as written, to the
-- sixteenth level of calls: what normalization then copies into the caller is exactly what is not kept.
-- (A definition's value already has the definitions it calls unfolded, so keeping a call is decided
-- here, on codes, before anything is evaluated.) A name left at the bound is unfolded by evaluation
inline-src : Lst Word → Code → Code
inline-src hs c = w-iter #16 (glob-map (λ g d → if w-mem g hs then none else src-of g) #0) c
